  "content_html": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjiYJPAm84oR3355jnNlHmNwiPqVmvALUOfbGD4zU52Ki1L4KhkX-u7PehC4FMyNeLEWRp7902hChkHdOJkXbvYISL4fC3sW1R-KGIJ0pmghlHxc-GjbvJnWnrLtbgtAorCJfU9-uyj4NXxingMIUxQOuOLMcckSrr5WGrDqnQRyK-xKVDlJtvJuN8_pQ/s449/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"410\" data-original-width=\"449\" height=\"183\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjiYJPAm84oR3355jnNlHmNwiPqVmvALUOfbGD4zU52Ki1L4KhkX-u7PehC4FMyNeLEWRp7902hChkHdOJkXbvYISL4fC3sW1R-KGIJ0pmghlHxc-GjbvJnWnrLtbgtAorCJfU9-uyj4NXxingMIUxQOuOLMcckSrr5WGrDqnQRyK-xKVDlJtvJuN8_pQ/w200-h183/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" width=\"200\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><h2 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הָהָר הַטּוֹב,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְהַלְּבָנוֹן.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְהָעָם חָכָם,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְנָבוֹן.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְהַכֹּל מִתְפָּאֲרִים,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּשִׂיאוֹן,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הוּא שְׂנִיר, הוּא חֶרְמוֹן, הוּא שִׂרְיֹן</span></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\"><span data-end=\"108\" data-start=\"80\">כשתלך בארץ - תן לה לדבר.<br /></span><br data-end=\"111\" data-start=\"108\" />לא תמיד היא זקוקה להסבר או לתיווך.<br data-end=\"148\" data-start=\"145\" />היופי שבה לא צועק, הוא נרמז -<br data-end=\"180\" data-start=\"177\" />בשביל צדדי, באבן עתיקה, ברוח שבין עצי הזית.<br /><br />ולפעמים, דווקא במקום הפשוט ביותר,<br data-end=\"267\" data-start=\"264\" />תשמע את הלב שלך עונה לה.</span></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\"></span></p><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"כָּל הַמְהַלֵּךְ אַרְבַּע אַמּוֹת בְּאֶרֶץ יִשְׂרָאֵל - מֻבְטָח לוֹ שֶׁהוּא בֶּן הָעוֹלָם הַבָּא\"</span></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2><p><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\">'חֶרְמוֹן' = 304 = 'מוֹרִיד הַטַּל'</span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\">(רמז לפסוק \"כְּטַל חֶרְמוֹן שֶׁיֹּרֵד עַל הַרְרֵי צִיּוֹן)</span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><br /></span></p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"></span></p><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; counter-reset: templateify 0; margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px 20px 0px 0px; text-align: right;\"><li style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span>'</span>וְאַמְּצֵהוּ<span>' / '</span>וְאַלֵּימְהִי<span>'</span><br /></span></span><span>❖לחזק אותו - שיהי</span>ה אַלִּים (לא במובן שלילי)</li><li style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">'מְלַמֵּד' / 'מַלֵּיף'<br /></span></span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span>&nbsp;מחנך, מאלף - אולפן.</li><li style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'וְהֵפִיץ' / 'וִיבַדַּר'<br /></span>❖&nbsp;יפזר - מִתְבַּדֵּר ברוח.</li><li style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">'לָנֻס' / 'לְמִעְרַק'<br /></span></span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span>&nbsp;לברוח - עריק.</li><li style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'תִתְאַוֶּה' / 'תִּרּוֹג'<br /></span>❖&nbsp;תחמוד - עֶרְגָּה.</li></ol><h2 style=\"display: inline !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><h2 style=\"display: inline !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><br /></span></h2></span></div>👁️ מבט חד</span><br /></h2><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"לֹא תֹסִפוּ ... וְלֹא תִגְרְעוּ מִמֶּנּוּ\"</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjL9qWSR3pA7ACHgxrJDqKFK3Sq8pXCnWwrNrpl7ALR_EYhhw1C9JD9VirN2PZc19wQHuNNSmvlYqskaXYmdtg5nCbXfTaYD5R0N8nA0ePLnvAYfOHuDl6UUgxo10Fi8-ehDPCfwMkGoelx_XzLIpmbCy9j18pewyyDTHL3BtASHd0AVi3w6WBq9RYDtoY/s1536/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jul%2021,%202025,%2006_49_43%20PM.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1536\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjL9qWSR3pA7ACHgxrJDqKFK3Sq8pXCnWwrNrpl7ALR_EYhhw1C9JD9VirN2PZc19wQHuNNSmvlYqskaXYmdtg5nCbXfTaYD5R0N8nA0ePLnvAYfOHuDl6UUgxo10Fi8-ehDPCfwMkGoelx_XzLIpmbCy9j18pewyyDTHL3BtASHd0AVi3w6WBq9RYDtoY/w133-h200/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jul%2021,%202025,%2006_49_43%20PM.png\" width=\"133\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">תוספת ליצירה מושלמת - הנה&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מגרעת</span></div></span></div></div></div>"
}
